  "build.guideWorker.footerFaqIntro": ". FAQ —",
  "build.guideWorker.footerIntro": "Are you an employer? See the",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksBody": ": you fill out a profile, apply to jobs, and optionally add a video resume and a paid trial task. Paid jobs (like a Trial) earn you ",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksCashback": "2% AEV cashback",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksFree": "free",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksIntro": "For job seekers, QBuild is ",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksNoFee": ". No fee to unlock contacts.",
  "build.guideWorker.howItWorksTitle": "How it works in 30 seconds",
  "build.guideWorker.pageSubtitle": "From profile to hire — and why it's free for you.",
  "build.guideWorker.pageTitle": "Guide for job seekers",
  "build.guideWorker.step1CtaLabel": "Go to profile →",
  "build.guideWorker.step1Intro": "Minimum: your job title, a short summary, and ",
  "build.guideWorker.step1Note": " badge in your profile (a link to LinkedIn/portfolio/certificates — we review within 1–2 business days). Your public profile is ",
  "build.guideWorker.step1Skill": "2+ skills",
  "build.guideWorker.step1Title": "Fill out your profile",
  "build.guideWorker.step1Trust": " — that gets you into recommendations and employer search. Want more trust? Request the ",
  "build.guideWorker.step1VerifiedBadge": "✓ Verified",
  "build.guideWorker.step2CtaLabel": "Browse jobs →",
  "build.guideWorker.step2End": ": no fee to apply, no premium paywall on contacts.",
  "build.guideWorker.step2Free": "free",
  "build.guideWorker.step2Intro": "The Jobs section has filters by city, skill, and salary. For job seekers, everything is ",
  "build.guideWorker.step2Title": "Find jobs",
  "build.guideWorker.step3AiScore": "AI scores your answers on a 100-point scale",
  "build.guideWorker.step3End": ", and a good score moves you up their list.",
  "build.guideWorker.step3Intro": "The ",
  "build.guideWorker.step3Middle": " lets you apply right from the list, or open the job for the full form with questions. If the employer added questions, answer thoughtfully: ",
  "build.guideWorker.step3QuickApply": "“Quick apply” button",
  "build.guideWorker.step3Title": "Apply",
  "build.guideWorker.step4Body": "A short video makes you stand out: the employer sees you \"live\" before the call. Especially helpful if your experience is hard to fit into text.",
  "build.guideWorker.step4Title": "Record a video resume (optional)",
  "build.guideWorker.step5End": " task to see your skills in action. Complete it, get paid, and the employer gets proof of your skills without a lengthy interview.",
  "build.guideWorker.step5Intro": "After approving your application, the employer may offer a ",
  "build.guideWorker.step5Middle": " — a small, ",
  "build.guideWorker.step5Paid": "paid",
  "build.guideWorker.step5Title": "Complete a trial task (Trial)",
  "build.guideWorker.step5Trial": "Trial",
  "build.guideWorker.step6Body": "Direct messages with the employer — no premium paywall on either side. Reach an agreement and you're hired. After the work is done, both sides leave reviews: your reputation grows and unlocks better jobs.",
  "build.guideWorker.step6CtaLabel": "Messages →",
  "build.guideWorker.step6Title": "Chat and get hired",
  "build.guideWorker.tipBody": "In your profile → “Job alerts,” set keywords and skills. When a matching job appears, you'll get an email and can be first to apply.",
  "build.guideWorker.tipTitle": "💡 Tip: Job Alerts",
  "build.help.employers.a1": "Click \"New project\", describe the site and budget. Once created, the \"+ Add vacancy\" button appears right on the project page.",
  "build.help.employers.a2": "$0. Free on all plans. We only charge a Pay-per-Hire commission (from 6% on the Gold tier) when you actually hire.",
  "build.help.employers.a3": "If the vacancy has screening questions, Claude AI scores each candidate's answer on a 100-point scale. The score and red flags are shown on the application card.",
  "build.help.employers.a4": "Open the vacancy page → the \"Applications\" section → the \"↓ CSV\" button. The file includes names, email, city, AI score, and status.",
  "build.help.employers.a5": "Boost pins the vacancy at the top of the /build/vacancies feed for 7 days. 1 boost = 990 ₽. The Pro plan includes 5 boosts/month.",
  "build.help.employers.a6": "In the Admin → Users section, find the candidate and click \"verify\". The ✓ badge will appear on their public profile.",
  "build.help.employers.q1": "How do I create a project and add vacancies?",
  "build.help.employers.q2": "How much does posting a vacancy cost?",
  "build.help.employers.q3": "What is AI scoring of applications?",
