  "build.help.employers.q6": "How do I verify a candidate?",
  "build.help.guidesEmployer": "for employers",
  "build.help.guidesIntro": "Step-by-step guides:",
  "build.help.guidesWorker": "for job seekers",
  "build.help.workers.a1": "Go to the \"Vacancies\" section. Use filters for city, skill, and salary. Click \"Quick apply\" right from the list, or open the vacancy for the full form with questions.",
  "build.help.workers.a2": "A paid test task from the employer. After approving your application, the employer may offer a Trial — a small paid task to confirm your skills. You get paid once it's done.",
  "build.help.workers.a3": "Go to \"Profile\" → the \"Verification badge\" section → click \"Request verification\". Attach a link to your LinkedIn, portfolio, or certificates. We review within 1-2 business days.",
  "build.help.workers.a4": "When you pay for orders (subscription, Trial tasks) you earn 2% back in native AEV tokens. You can claim them into your AEV wallet from the \"Pricing\" section.",
  "build.help.workers.a5": "In the \"Profile\" section → \"Job alerts\", set your keywords and skills. You'll get an email whenever a new vacancy matches your criteria.",
  "build.help.workers.a6": "Your public profile at /build/u/[id] is visible to everyone. Go to Profile → \"Open public profile\" to see how employers view you.",
