  "build.pricing.hero.subtitle": "Unlike HH, every résumé is visible on every plan. Free Forever really is forever. Pay-per-Hire is 0 ₽ until the candidate starts work. Pro and Agency give you exactly the features listed on the card — no hidden fees for \"boosting\" or \"premium listings\".",
