  "build.successStories.case1City": "Almaty",
  "build.successStories.case1Detail": "Three Trial Jobs in one day of screening — the candidate demonstrated a spot weld on a DN100 pipe fragment. Now installing heating networks at the Novy Gorizont residential complex.",
  "build.successStories.case1MetricLabel": "days to hire",
  "build.successStories.case1Name": "Sergey Nurmagambetov",
  "build.successStories.case1Quote": "It used to take 3 weeks to find a welder. Through QBuild I found and hired one in 4 days. The AI coach flagged at the application stage that the candidate had passed safety training and held all clearances.",
  "build.successStories.case1Role": "Site foreman, StroyPartner LLP",
  "build.successStories.case2City": "Shymkent → Astana",
  "build.successStories.case2Detail": "Applied to 2 vacancies, did the video interview right from his phone. The employer saw an AI score of 87/100 and invited him to a Trial. Day one: installing partitions at the Expo business center.",
  "build.successStories.case2MetricLabel": "AI application score",
  "build.successStories.case2Name": "Akbar Usmanov",
  "build.successStories.case2Quote": "I'm a bricklayer from Shymkent. I never believed I could find a job in Astana through a website. I uploaded a photo of my ID and a voice résumé — Claude assembled the profile itself. A week later I was already on site.",
  "build.successStories.case2Role": "5th-grade bricklayer",
  "build.successStories.case3City": "Almaty",
  "build.successStories.case3Detail": "Closed 47 vacancies in a quarter: 12 electricians, 18 welders, 17 concrete workers. Average time-to-close — 6 days. Reached Silver tier in Loyalty — commission dropped from 12% to 8%.",
  "build.successStories.case3MetricLabel": "hires per quarter",
  "build.successStories.case3Name": "Aigul Dzhaksybekova",
  "build.successStories.case3Quote": "We run an agency and post 15-20 vacancies a month. Pay-per-Hire at 6% instead of the usual 20% agency fee — the savings turned out to be substantial. Plus Match-score sorts the candidates automatically.",
  "build.successStories.case3Role": "HR Director, KazStroyGroup",
  "build.successStories.case4City": "Pavlodar",
  "build.successStories.case4Detail": "Found the vacancy using the '1000V clearance' filter. Recorded a video résumé in 3 minutes. The employer reviewed only 4 candidates instead of 20 — the platform filtered them by Match-score.",
  "build.successStories.case4MetricLabel": "days from résumé to offer",
  "build.successStories.case4Name": "Dmitry Li",
  "build.successStories.case4Quote": "I signed up on Friday evening. On Saturday I did a Trial — installed 2 outlet blocks from a photo assignment. By Monday I already had an offer. The site really works.",
