  "build.whyAevion.ctaTitle": "Ready to try?",
  "build.whyAevion.eyebrow": "AEVION · QBuild",
  "build.whyAevion.feature1Body": "Claude writes your resume in industry voice, answers hiring questions, and finds matching vacancies in a minute.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature1Title": "AI Coach",
  "build.whyAevion.feature2Body": "Recruiter posts 5 short questions per vacancy. Claude scores every answer 0–100 and surfaces red flags.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature2Title": "AI answer scoring",
  "build.whyAevion.feature3Body": "Face and voice instead of a wall of text. 10× more memorable, 10× faster to screen.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature3Title": "30-second video intro",
  "build.whyAevion.feature4Body": "Instead of ghosting — a paid micro-task. Real skill check, real payment on delivery.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature4Title": "Trial Jobs",
  "build.whyAevion.feature5Body": "Medical check, safety training, driver's license, owned tools, ready-from-date — built into the profile and the search filters.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature5Title": "Industry-specific signals",
  "build.whyAevion.feature6Body": "No middlemen, no paid contacts. Open an application and message the candidate directly.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature6Title": "Direct DMs",
  "build.whyAevion.feature7Body": "Algorithm computes overlap against required vacancy skills and sorts the list by relevance.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature7Title": "Candidate match-score",
  "build.whyAevion.feature8Body": "2% of every PAID order returns to your AEV wallet. Stacks across orders, spends on the platform.",
  "build.whyAevion.feature8Title": "AEV cashback",
  "build.whyAevion.footerHome": "AEVION home",
  "build.whyAevion.footerLine": "AEVION QBuild · part of the AEVION platform · ",
  "build.whyAevion.footerPricing": "Pricing",
  "build.whyAevion.founderEyebrow": "From the founder",
  "build.whyAevion.founderName": "— Dossymbek, AEVION founder",
  "build.whyAevion.founderText": "QBuild exists because we got tired of watching construction lose weeks on “you applied — we'll get back to you.” We took the AEVION stack (Claude API, AEV token, AI scoring) and built a platform where hiring takes days, not months. We have no VC pressure to sell packs — we earn when you actually hire. Hit a wall? Email me — I read every message.",
  "build.whyAevion.heroBody": "QBuild is HeadHunter rebuilt for the construction industry. The AI coach writes resumes. Claude scores candidate answers. Trial Jobs replace screening calls.",
  "build.whyAevion.heroCtaPrimary": "Start free →",
  "build.whyAevion.heroCtaSecondary": "Compare plans",
  "build.whyAevion.heroNote": "Free Forever — really forever. Cancel any subscription in one click.",
  "build.whyAevion.heroTitleA": "Construction hiring —",
  "build.whyAevion.heroTitleB": "no packs, no ghosting, no 25% agency cuts",
  "build.whyAevion.killerEyebrow": "8 killer features HeadHunter doesn't have",
  "build.whyAevion.killerTitle": "Built for construction — not a generic job site",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyBody": "Pay-per-Hire starts at 12% and drops to 6% — already meaningfully below the 15–25% agency take, even on your first hire. Trial Jobs count too.",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyEyebrow": "Loyalty — pay by results",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyTier1Hint": "From the first hire",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyTier2Hint": "from 3 hires",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyTier3Hint": "from 10 hires",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyTier4Hint": "from 25 hires",
  "build.whyAevion.loyaltyTitle": "More hires → lower commission",
  "build.whyAevion.step1Body": "Claude parses a PDF, scan, or voice transcript into a structured profile in seconds.",
  "build.whyAevion.step1Title": "Upload your resume by voice or photo",
  "build.whyAevion.step2Body": "Coach flags missing fields, suggests improvements, and matches you to currently open vacancies.",
  "build.whyAevion.step2Title": "Get AI guidance",
  "build.whyAevion.step3Body": "You answer the recruiter's questions; Claude scores each answer in parallel so the recruiter can decide fast.",
  "build.whyAevion.step3Title": "Apply — Claude helps",
  "build.whyAevion.step4Body": "Instead of “we'll call you” — a paid 1-to-3 day trial. Deliver it, get hired.",
  "build.whyAevion.step4Title": "Trial → Hire",
  "build.whyAevion.workflowEyebrow": "How it looks",
  "build.whyAevion.workflowTitle": "From “need a job” to first day — in 72 hours",
