  "constitution.pricing.compare.feature.saved": "Saved scenarios",
  "constitution.pricing.compare.feature.themes": "Custom themes",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.aiNotWorking.a": "Constitution runs on QCoreAI, configured with 5 providers (Claude, GPT-4, Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok). If none are configured, it falls back to a heuristic stub. Pro gets all providers with priority on speed and quality.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.aiNotWorking.q": "What if the AI advisor isn't working?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.cancelAnytime.a": "Yes. Payment runs through Gumroad, and you can cancel any time from your account — Pro/Team access stays active until the end of the paid period. No auto-renewals without confirmation, no hidden periods.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.cancelAnytime.q": "Can I cancel my subscription at any time?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.dataStored.a": "Scenarios: title, sliders (8 numbers), the computed regime, metrics, timestamp. We don't ask for any personal data. Artifacts published to Planet add a QSign signature (HMAC-SHA256) and a public publishedAt. Anonymous votes are hashed via fingerprint(IP+UA) — we don't store the raw IP.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.dataStored.q": "What data is stored?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.diffProFree.a": "Free is capped at 5 saved scenarios and 10 AI requests/day. The Free PDF carries an «unsigned draft» watermark unless signed via QSign. Pro removes all these limits and adds custom themes, a watermark-free embed widget, and personal analytics.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.diffProFree.q": "How is Pro different from Free?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.education.a": "Yes — the Team plan is built for exactly this. Instructors and students get separate accounts, shared scenarios, and per-person Academy progress. If you have special requirements (large class, white-label), email support@aevion.app and we'll work out custom pricing.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.education.q": "Can Constitution be used in courses?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.embed.a": "Free gives you a base embed with the AEVION watermark. Pro/Team get a clean embed with no branding — Team can even use its own logo. Iframe snippet: <iframe src=\"https://aevion.app/constitution/embed?preset=nordic&theme=light\" width=580 height=500>. URL params: ?artifact, ?sliders, ?preset, ?country, ?theme, ?compact.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.embed.q": "How does embedding on another site work?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.grant.a": "Yes. For universities, research centers, and nonprofits, we give the Team plan for free once confirmed via a .edu/.org email. Apply: email support@aevion.app with the subject «Education grant».",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.grant.q": "Is there an education grant?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.qsign.a": "QSign is an HMAC-SHA256 signature from AEVION's infrastructure. A signed scenario gets a unique signature hex that can be re-verified at any time via /api/qsign/verify. That means the same scenario gets the same signature for two different users — the artifact becomes verifiable.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.qsign.q": "What is QSign and why sign a scenario?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.selfHost.a": "The code is open — Express + Postgres backend, Next.js frontend. Deploying to your own Railway/Vercel takes about an hour. The hosted SaaS gives you: Pro features, support, auto-updates, and the shared Planet leaderboard with all users. Self-host makes sense if you have >100 seats or need on-prem.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.selfHost.q": "Can I self-host Constitution?",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.teamSeats.a": "One Team account gives you 5 individual Pro logins with shared billing and an admin panel. Perfect for a university class (instructor + 4 assistants), a think-tank, or a 5-person research group. An extra seat costs $7/mo.",
  "constitution.pricing.faq.teamSeats.q": "What does «5 seats» mean in Team?",
  "constitution.pricing.footer.disclaimer": "Payments via Gumroad. Cancel anytime. 14-day money-back guarantee. Questions —",
  "constitution.pricing.header.subtitle": "Free to start. $9/mo — unlimited. $49/mo — for teams. Cancel anytime, no hidden periods.",
