  "pricing.home.faq.billingChange.a": "Pro-rated by day. On an upgrade, the credit for unused time on the old plan is applied automatically. On a downgrade, the credit stays on your account until the next cycle.",
  "pricing.home.faq.billingChange.q": "How is billing calculated when I switch plans?",
  "pricing.home.faq.bothSuites.a": "Get Business — both circuits are included, no separate bundles. You'll save ~$20/mo versus buying bundles on top of Pro.",
  "pricing.home.faq.bothSuites.q": "What if I want both AI Suite + IP Suite?",
  "pricing.home.faq.cancelExport.a": "Yes. Export all your QRight objects and QSign signatures to JSON/PDF — a button in your dashboard. After cancellation there's a 30-day grace period, then soft-delete with another 60 days of recovery.",
  "pricing.home.faq.cancelExport.q": "Can I cancel and take my data with me?",
  "pricing.home.faq.dataResidency.a": "By default — EU (Frankfurt) plus RU/KZ mirrors for localization. For Enterprise — choice of region or your own VPC.",
  "pricing.home.faq.dataResidency.q": "Where is data stored?",
  "pricing.home.faq.eduPlan.a": "Free covers 95% of student use cases. For universities and hackathons — get in touch, we set up sponsorship accounts.",
  "pricing.home.faq.eduPlan.q": "Is there an education plan?",
  "pricing.home.faq.onPremise.a": "Enterprise only. Includes Docker / Kubernetes artifacts, a runbook, and an audit. Minimum contract term is 12 months.",
  "pricing.home.faq.onPremise.q": "Is an on-premise install supported?",
  "pricing.home.faq.singleModule.a": "Any add-on module can be bought on top of the Free plan. You get exactly the module you need without paying extra for the rest.",
  "pricing.home.faq.singleModule.q": "Can I buy just one module without a plan?",
  "pricing.home.faq.vsCompetitors.a": "One account, one billing, one audit trail. One signature = one registry record, one payment — all linked. The modules know about each other: the AI agent sees the signature, the signature sees the payment, the registry sees everything.",
  "pricing.home.faq.vsCompetitors.q": "How is AEVION better than DocuSign + OpenAI + Stripe combined?",
