  "pricing.security.doc.soc2.title": "SOC 2 Report",
  "pricing.security.docs.heading": "Request security documents",
  "pricing.security.docs.subheading": "Documents are provided to current and prospective Business and Enterprise customers.",
  "pricing.security.hero.body": "AEVION was built with enterprise-grade security from day one. Customer data lives in isolated namespaces, encrypted with AES-256 at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit. We undergo independent SOC 2 Type II audits, meet GDPR, 152-FZ, and PCI DSS requirements, and publish our security policies openly.",
  "pricing.security.hero.title": "Security & Compliance",
  "pricing.security.pillar.access.body": "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) with granular, object-level permissions. MFA is mandatory for every account. SSO via SAML 2.0 / OIDC. The principle of least privilege applies to all service accounts.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.access.title": "Access control",
  "pricing.security.pillar.audit.body": "An immutable audit log for every action in the system: who, when, from which IP, what changed. Logs are retained for at least 365 days. Export to SIEM (Splunk, Datadog, ELK) via webhook or S3.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.audit.title": "Audit & logging",
  "pricing.security.pillar.bcp.body": "RPO ≤ 1 hour, RTO ≤ 4 hours. Data replicated across 2+ availability zones. Daily backups with restore verification. DR drills run quarterly. Uptime SLA follows the published ladder (GET /api/quotas): Build 99.0%, Scale 99.5%, Enterprise 99.9%.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.bcp.title": "BCP / Disaster Recovery",
  "pricing.security.pillar.encryption.body": "Data at rest is encrypted with AES-256. Data in transit is protected by TLS 1.3. Keys are stored in HSM-compatible vaults and rotated every 90 days. BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) is supported for Enterprise customers.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.encryption.title": "Data encryption",
  "pricing.security.pillar.infra.body": "Multi-tenant infrastructure with strict namespace-level isolation. Kubernetes with network policies and pod security standards. Every image is scanned by Trivy and Snyk before deployment. Runtime protection via Falco.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.infra.title": "Infrastructure",
  "pricing.security.pillar.secdev.body": "OWASP Top-10 checks in CI. Static analysis (SonarQube, Semgrep) and DAST on staging. Mandatory security review for changes to auth, billing, and data-access layers. Weekly dependency audits.",
  "pricing.security.pillar.secdev.title": "Secure development",
  "pricing.security.pillars.heading": "6 layers of protection",
  "pricing.security.pillars.subheading": "Comprehensive protection at every layer — from code to hardware.",
